    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm looking at expanding our component sourcing for next year. we're looking at two main options: nigeria and vietnam. can you give me a quick breakdown of the general business culture and reliability of suppliers in both places? just need a high-level comparison to help decide where to focus our vetting. thanks.",
